{%- doc -%}
  One question in a FAQ list: the question, and the answer opening reveals.

  Renders [ui-panel] in its `bar` variant and nothing else, for the reason
  [_ui-product-chip] gives — the look belongs to the kit and this is the merchant's
  handle on it.

  It is a block rather than a run of settings on the section because a FAQ is a list
  the merchant lengthens, shortens and reorders. That is the rule
  `docs/section-settings.md` opens with, and a numbered `question_1` through
  `question_5` is the smell it names.

  The rows can be an exclusive accordion — opening one shuts the rest — through the
  `name` attribute HTML gives `<details>`, which needs no script and degrades to
  ordinary independent rows in a browser that has not caught up. The group is the
  section's, so the switch lives there and every row in one section shares one name.
{%- enddoc -%}

{%- liquid
  assign answer = block.settings.answer

  # One group per section, so two FAQ sections on one page do not close each other's
  # rows. `section` is in scope inside a block, the way `_carousel-content` reads it.
  assign group = ''
  if section.settings.exclusive
    assign group = 'name="faq-' | append: section.id | append: '"'
  endif
-%}

{%- if block.settings.question != blank -%}
  <div class="ui-faq-item" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
    {% render 'ui-panel',
      variant: 'bar',
      title: block.settings.question,
      body: answer,
      collapsible: true,
      animated: true,
      open: block.settings.open,
      attributes: group
    %}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}

{% stylesheet %}
  /* The wrapper the editor needs for its outline must not size itself: a row is as
     wide as the list, whatever the question runs to. */
  .ui-faq-item > .ui-panel {
    inline-size: 100%;
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Question",
  "tag": null,
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "question",
      "label": "Question",
      "default": "What types of treats do you offer?"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "answer",
      "label": "Answer",
      "default": "<p>Handcrafted Krispie treats in twelve-packs, gift boxes and party bars, plus custom photo treats and gluten-free options.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "open",
      "label": "Open to begin with",
      "info": "With the section set to open one at a time, only the last row marked this way stays open.",
      "default": false
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Question"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
